{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54428","headline":"梦中作 · 崔致远","name":"梦中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粪墙师有诫，经笥我无慙。\n乱世成何事，唯添七不堪。\n（《大正藏》本《唐大荐福寺故寺主翻经大德法藏和尚传》）（按：此诗爲崔致远天复四年春梦中遇宰予、边孝先二贤，前二句爲二贤句，後二句爲崔续成之。\n按：崔致远归国後诗，今获见十一首，附录於次，以便参考。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54428.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54428","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}